== parent_id is a mirror
--- create 'X (to be mirrored into a mirror)'
    POST /api/v1/nodes
    req: {"parent_id":"532a07fa-2a20-477d-86df-0d721ef92956","name":"X (to be mirrored into a mirror)","position":"bottom"}
    -> 200 content-type=application/json
    {"item_id": "1d2eb798-ba3a-4e5e-bdc0-09af0917f7f0"}
--- MIRROR X -> M1 (parent is a mirror)
    POST /api/v1/nodes/1d2eb798-ba3a-4e5e-bdc0-09af0917f7f0/mirror
    req: {"parent_id":"339a0a43-1802-42ad-a675-d282a865192b"}
    -> 200 content-type=application/json
    {"item_id": "ff827bec-c085-45de-ba04-204ad020b1ae", "origin_id": "1d2eb798-ba3a-4e5e-bdc0-09af0917f7f0"}
--- GET MX
    GET /api/v1/nodes/ff827bec-c085-45de-ba04-204ad020b1ae
    -> 200 content-type=application/json
    {"node": {"completed": false, "completedAt": null, "createdAt": 1791834525, "data": {"layoutMode": "bullets"}, "id": "ff827bec-c085-45de-ba04-204ad020b1ae", "modifiedAt": 1791834525, "name": "", "note": "", "parent_id": "66590f9d-4ea3-4768-b34c-d85e10fb45a3", "priority": 50}}
--- list M1
    GET /api/v1/nodes?parent_id=339a0a43-1802-42ad-a675-d282a865192b
    -> 200 content-type=application/json
    {"nodes": []}
--- list O
    GET /api/v1/nodes?parent_id=66590f9d-4ea3-4768-b34c-d85e10fb45a3
    -> 200 content-type=application/json
    {"nodes": [{"completed": false, "completedAt": null, "createdAt": 1791834521, "data": {"layoutMode": "bullets"}, "id": "73cc4887-c896-41d8-8ad3-27522c5cbcf0", "modifiedAt": 1791834521, "name": "oc1", "note": null, "parent_id": "66590f9d-4ea3-4768-b34c-d85e10fb45a3", "priority": 100}, {"completed": false, "completedAt": null, "createdAt": 1791834525, "data": {"layoutMode": "bullets"}, "id": "ff827bec-c085-45de-ba04-204ad020b1ae", "modifiedAt": 1791834525, "name": "", "note": "", "parent_id": "66590f9d-4ea3-4768-b34c-d85e10fb45a3", "priority": 50}]}

== mirror onto itself / into own subtree
--- MIRROR O -> O
    POST /api/v1/nodes/66590f9d-4ea3-4768-b34c-d85e10fb45a3/mirror
    req: {"parent_id":"66590f9d-4ea3-4768-b34c-d85e10fb45a3"}
    -> 400 content-type=application/json
    {"code": "invalid_request", "message": "Cannot mirror a node under itself"}
--- MIRROR O -> oc1 (child of origin)
    POST /api/v1/nodes/66590f9d-4ea3-4768-b34c-d85e10fb45a3/mirror
