    req: {"parent_id":"339a0a43-1802-42ad-a675-d282a865192b"}
    -> 400 content-type=application/json
    {"code": "invalid_request", "message": "Cannot mirror a node under itself"}
--- MIRROR M1 -> M1
    POST /api/v1/nodes/339a0a43-1802-42ad-a675-d282a865192b/mirror
    req: {"parent_id":"339a0a43-1802-42ad-a675-d282a865192b"}
    -> 400 content-type=application/json
    {"code": "invalid_request", "message": "Cannot mirror a node under itself"}
