== DELETE /mirror on non-mirror and nonexistent
--- DELETE /mirror on origin O
    DELETE /api/v1/nodes/66590f9d-4ea3-4768-b34c-d85e10fb45a3/mirror
    -> 400 content-type=application/json
    {"code": "invalid_request", "message": "Node is not a mirror"}
--- DELETE /mirror on plain node X
    DELETE /api/v1/nodes/1d2eb798-ba3a-4e5e-bdc0-09af0917f7f0/mirror
    -> 400 content-type=application/json
    {"code": "invalid_request", "message": "Node is not a mirror"}
--- DELETE /mirror on nonexistent (unscoped)
    DELETE /api/v1/nodes/0e8de562-fb2c-4705-8b91-1f02024543fc/mirror
    -> 404 content-type=application/json
    {"code": "not_found", "message": "Item not found"}
--- GET /mirror (wrong method)
    GET /api/v1/nodes/339a0a43-1802-42ad-a675-d282a865192b/mirror
    -> 405 content-type=application/json
    {"allowed_methods": ["POST", "DELETE"], "error": "Method not allowed"}

